  "snippet": "Available digital tax parcel data for Organized Towns in Maine. Join with \"Maine Parcels Organized Towns ADB\" table for ownership information where provided.\n\nNotice: There is no complete statewide parcel data layer for Maine. Communities submit updates on an unscheduled basis; data for many towns is more than fifteen years old. Please evaluate accordingly.",
